  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UYrNpKJN/images/28fbdff482a08cd94d0873f5bc26922efe5e5e11.png\" alt=\"堆叠方块\" width=\"332\" height=\"96\"></p><p><strong>前所未有的存储优化体验。</strong>将八个方块压缩为一个，例如原木、石砖、下界岩、砖块等，为你的重要资源腾出宝贵空间。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=26.1&amp;showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下载 26.1 更新\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a></p><h2>🧰 功能特性</h2><ul>\n<li>使用线即可堆叠原木、石头、圆石、下界岩、西瓜、南瓜等方块。</li>\n<li>单个简易箱子可存储多达 13,824 个物品，释放空间用于存放其他资源。</li>\n<li>通过堆叠方块整理资源，打造更整洁高效的存储系统。</li>\n</ul><h2>🛠️ 扩展模组</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks-farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">堆叠方块：农夫乐事</a><br>\n<ul>\n<li>增加使用绳子制作可堆叠方块的能力。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks-supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\">堆叠方块：补充品</a><br>\n<ul>\n<li>可压缩灰烬砖、黑石瓦片、涂泥等方块。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"为购买笔记本电脑攒钱中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我按钮\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐赠按钮\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
